					"id": 730690403,
					"content": "嗯。他是兰耶娑，也是采歌人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰罗摩"
				},
				{
					"id": 730690404,
					"content": "兰耶娑你好！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730690405,
					"content": "你好！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690406
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730690406,
					"content": "#「接下来唱的是…一位{M#小姐}{F#少年}，追寻至珍之物的诗。在旅途开始时，{M#她}{F#他}双眸的颜色是没有一丝阴霾的琥珀…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰耶娑"
				},
				{
					"id": 730690407,
					"content": "…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690408,
						730690409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730690408,
					"content": "感觉怪怪的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690410
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730690410,
					"content": "兰耶娑他是采歌的兰那罗里胆子最大的，所以会经常学到那菈的歌。所以，说话比较特别。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰罗摩"
				},
				{
					"id": 730690411,
					"content": "「我们的宿命，是一同诞生的珍珠…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690412,
						730690413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰耶娑"
				},
				{
					"id": 730690412,
					"content": "完全没办法交流…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690416
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730690416,
					"content": "言归正传…既然兰耶娑是采歌者的话，这附近也有觉树之堂吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690417
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730690417,
					"content": "兰拉吉在这里留下了最后的歌。这样的话，附近应该就有莎兰树！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690418
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰罗摩"
				},
				{
					"id": 730690418,
					"content": "#既然如此，那我们也帮忙吧，{NICKNAME}！赶紧拿到恒素果！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690419
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730690419,
					"content": "「啊啊，这份思念，会结出像石榴一样血红的果实。即使命运将你的双眼蒙上…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690420,
						730690421
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰耶娑"
				},
				{
					"id": 730690420,
					"content": "为了帮助拉娜…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690425
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730690425,
					"content": "#和之前一样，在玫瑰当中，隐藏着歌曲。既然是那菈{NICKNAME}和派蒙，一定能顺利找到！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690426,
						730690428
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰罗摩"
				},
				{
					"id": 730690426,
					"content": "交给我吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690427
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730690427,
					"content": "嗯！交给你了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730690428,
					"content": "「我会点亮你的诗。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690429
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730690429,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730690421,
					"content": "「也无法夺走唇边的歌…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690422
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730690422,
					"content": "#噫——{NICKNAME}，你在干什么啦！好奇怪喔！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690423
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730690423,
					"content": "#那菈{NICKNAME}应该和兰耶娑很合得来呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690424
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰罗摩"
				},
				{
					"id": 730690424,
					"content": "#不要鼓励{M#他}{F#她}啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690425
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730690413,
					"content": "「啊啊，那罪恶般甜蜜的宿命。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690414
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730690414,
					"content": "#噫——{NICKNAME}，快停下！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730690415,
					"content": "#那菈{NICKNAME}好厉害！完全听不懂！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰罗摩"
				},
				{
					"id": 730690409,
					"content": "是吟游诗人？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690410
					]
				}
			]
		},
