					"nextDialogs": [
						730691207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰罗摩"
				},
				{
					"id": 730691207,
					"content": "要怎么取得恒素果？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730691208
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730691208,
					"content": "嗯。我们要先进入他的梦中，消除无留陀的影响。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730691209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰罗摩"
				},
				{
					"id": 730691209,
					"content": "「他」是指…莎兰树吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730691210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730691210,
					"content": "没错。如果准备好了，就伸出手，进入他的梦吧…",
