						730691904
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730691904,
					"content": "#好棒！那那菈{NICKNAME}和派蒙也有很多记忆、很多故事吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
